[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2575814105","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101204#issuecomment-2575814105","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101204","id":2575814105,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Zh83Z","user":{"login":"kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev","html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-07T17:06:19Z","updated_at":"2025-01-07T17:06:19Z","body":"There is a project setting to increase this, but the undo system does need to be reworked.\n\nThey can't be merged as they are created since it doesn't work with multiple carets and it caused issues with merging unrelated operations with the action system (that's how it used to work). They need to be merged afterward, which is more complicated. I think that the 'action' system can be repurposed to do the merging instead of messing with complex operations like it currently does.\n\nThe code removed in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/85325 shows how the system can already support multiple characters at a time.\n\n- see the discussion in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/85325\n- related https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/80624\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2575814105/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2576328986","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101204#issuecomment-2576328986","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101204","id":2576328986,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Zj6ka","user":{"login":"wareya","id":585488,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4NTQ4OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/585488?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wareya","html_url":"https://github.com/wareya","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wareya/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wareya/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wareya/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wareya/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wareya/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wareya/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wareya/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wareya/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wareya/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-07T22:13:42Z","updated_at":"2025-01-07T22:13:42Z","body":"Can't they be merged as they're created (rather than when the complex action is committed), but only if the editor's in the state that's currently used to chain complex actions together, and also only as long as you require a single action to be of a single type? i.e. no merging `NEWCHAR ; NEWCARET ; NEWCHAR`, only `NEWCHAR ; NEWCHAR`. Like if I just type \"asdf\" I can expect that to turn into one event before I'm done even if it's going into like seven cursors or something.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2576328986/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2576726188","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101204#issuecomment-2576726188","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101204","id":2576726188,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Zlbis","user":{"login":"wareya","id":585488,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4NTQ4OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/585488?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wareya","html_url":"https://github.com/wareya","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wareya/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wareya/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wareya/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wareya/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wareya/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wareya/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wareya/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wareya/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wareya/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-08T04:28:44Z","updated_at":"2025-01-08T04:28:44Z","body":"Made https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101261 to demonstrate what I mean by \"merged as they're created\". In my idea, the merging happens in the operation management system rather than in the operation itself. Not sure I got it 100% right (it passes tests and feels right when using it in a test project) but it's just a proof of concept.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2576726188/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]